    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client systems of information, with a focus on reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our proposed solution contribute to a focus on reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact, and what sustainable development strategies do our recommend? our, can indeed contribute to a focus on reducing energetic consumption and relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact. our have partnered with green hosting providers such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both based in France, who use 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification.  our digital sobriety practices include INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our digital sobriety practices typically reduce energy consumption by around 35% compared to our baseline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further support The client objectives, I recommend implementing Our digital sobriety practices and considering our carbon reporting capability, which follows GRI Standards, albeit partially. our can also facilitate e-waste management through our partnership with Ecologic, a certified WEEE recycling company in France." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By adopting these strategies, our can help minimize the environmental footprint of the client's information systems while promoting sustainable development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

